[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0002","text":"路加的粉丝"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0010","text":"（我，不会相信……………………）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0011","text":"SNS投稿１"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0020","text":"“斑鸠路加回来了！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0021","text":"路加的粉丝"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0030","text":"（……………………不对）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0031","text":"SNS投稿２"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0040","text":"“虽然转会风波闹了一阵子但组合挺好的嘛！神明大人回来了”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0041","text":"路加的粉丝"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0050","text":"（那个……不是路加…………）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0060","text":"啊──────────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0070","text":"手机，掉了\n没事吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0080","text":"没、没事……！\n本来屏幕就有裂痕……失礼了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0090","text":"（我，不会相信………………\n　在听到那个最喜欢的路加的声音之前……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_04_0100","text":"………………路………………\n是哪边来着……………………"}]
